# Docs last updated for version

v2.58.15

## How to use this file

When updating docs next time, run:

```bash
# Get all changes since docs were last updated
git log v2.58.15..HEAD --oneline
```

Then update this file to the new version after the docs PR is merged. Prefer
writing a release-notes page under docs/release-notes/ for every minor
release, so this file is a pointer rather than a changelog.

